   <narrative xml:lang="EN">DSIF - Ghana - Lavender Hill Sludge Treatment Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will provide an effective low-cost faecal sludge treatment plant at &quot;Lavender Hill&quot; in Accra Metropolitan Area. The project will provice an efficient and well-proven technological treatment plant solution, it addresses an apparent need, and will upgrade the negligible Waste management infrastructure existing in Accra.</narrative>
